      "content": "Thanks, that's a really strong narrative arc. I'm noticing that the timeline focuses almost entirely on the resistance and the colonial violence. To make sure the documentary is balanced, I'll need to mention the British side of things too. \n\nIn your view, was the British response actually a legitimate effort to maintain law and order against what they saw as a terrorist insurgency, or was that just a convenient excuse for their own political interests?",
